# `__Raw.schedPreemptExtLockAddr` or `__Raw.schedLockAddr`, so it refuses `runtime/DebugAgent.maxon` at the
# first call to one (E3004). Every table that TEACHES those rows — `RawIntrinsics`, `StdDialect`, the x64
# lowering, the `IatSlot` band, `TargetFacilities` — is left standing, so `C1` knows them and compiles the
# unshimmed tree into `C2`.
